meta {
  name: Absences
  seq: 16
}

docs {
  Teachers take attendance in the subjects they teach; each subject of a class
  has a limit of unexcused absences per semester. The teacher who recorded an
  absence, the homeroom teacher and admins can excuse or delete it. Uses
  `teacherToken` (Auth > Login as teacher), `studentToken` (Grades > Login as
  student) and the ids found in Grades and Teaching assignments, so run those
  first. The absence is recorded on a Sunday of last week (no lessons, so no seeded
  absence that day) and deleted again at the end.
}
